== an import with bad rows, into the MySQL store
products.csv: 8 rows, 2 taken, 6 rejected
  line 3: the SKU TEE-RED-M is on line 2 already
  line 4: the price "9,50" is not an amount like 12.50
  line 5: the SKU "cap-blk" holds "c": a SKU is upper-case letters, digits and '-'
  line 6: 5 fields where the header names 6
  line 7: the product TEE is named "Heroes tee" in apparel on line 2
  line 8: the SKU POSTER-A2 belongs to the product POSTER
  taken: TEE-RED-M (TEE, red / M) at 18.00
  taken: CAP-BLK (CAP, black) at 12.00
counts.xlsx: 7 rows, 2 taken, 5 rejected
  row 3: no location SHOP-X in the store
  row 4: the count "2.5" is not a whole number of units
  row 6: no variant NOPE-1 in the store
